# Minecraft Version(s): 26.3
## New: Guide to coordinates
- *"Take me to 100 64 -200"*, *"guide me to 300 -150"* or *"give me a route to x 100 z -200 in the nether"*: Merl leads you to any coordinates. Without a dimension she uses the one you're in; other dimensions (the Nether, the End, the Deep Blue…) work too, and she waits until you get there
